// Title: CobaltStrike Load by Rundll32
// ID: ae9c6a7c-9521-42a6-915e-5aaa8689d529
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Wojciech Lesicki
// Date: 2021-06-01
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218.011
// Description: Rundll32 can be use by Cobalt Strike with StartW function to load DLLs from the command line.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".dll") AND (where(CommandLine IENDSWITH " StartW") OR where(CommandLine IENDSWITH ",StartW"))) AND ((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\rundll32.exe")) OR (where(OriginalFileName = "RUNDLL32.EXE")) OR ((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "rundll32.exe") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "rundll32 ")))))
